Data note: the numbers and figures are reproducible from free, publicly
retrievable data. Free daily-history CSVs that CBOE publishes for public
download (e.g. VIX_History.csv) are included under figures/data/; the licensed
intraday option-chain snapshots and optionsDX end-of-day chains are NOT
redistributed here and are re-fetched by the scripts at run time, under each
vendor's own terms of use. See the "Data license" section of README.md.
